<title>USA: IMC Global FY shr $1.35 vs $2.34.</title>
<headline>IMC Global FY shr $1.35 vs $2.34.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.35		    $2.34</p>
<p> Net			127,100		  215,500</p>
<p> Net sales	    2,941,000		2,940,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  93,900		   91,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company reported a first quarter restructuring charge of $43.3 million.</p>
<p>The company reported operating earnings of $461.4 million compared to $566.6 million for the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>The company reported earnings per share of $2.18 versus $2.38 before an extraordinary charge of $8.1 million in 1996 and $3.5 million in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's year ended December 31.</p>
</text>
